## Changed

- Made the sampling result distinguish accepted samples from failed, null, and stale samples. The poll worker now reinstalls its deadline whenever no authoritative acceptance already did so, preventing fallback polling from stopping after a transient failure.
- Added deterministic `TestClock` coverage that proves an idle failed poll schedules and executes the next eight-second deadline.
- Moved provider retry-reset consumption into the retry schedule's delay boundary. Snapshot notifications are drained before backoff calculation, eliminating the separate reset-worker race with an immediately following terminal event.

Files touched: `packages/music-core/session/coordinator.ts`, `packages/music-core/session/provider.ts`, `packages/music-core/tests/session-coordinator.test.ts`.

